# The file rules' contract, checked against the filter's policy (`src/policy.rs`) and against the
# Seatbelt profile's rendered rules (the launcher's `SeatbeltProfileTest`).
#
# A case lists resolved lines, as the launcher and the guard write them, then paths with their
# answer: `read-only`, `pinned` (not read-only, but not to be renamed or unlinked) or `free`.
#
# `path` rows hold for both enforcement points. `folded` rows spell a name as a filesystem may
# fold it; the filter folds, and the profile relies on the volume resolving the spelling to the
# name before Seatbelt matches (doc/run-on-host.md, "The host command's filesystem rules"), so
# only the filter checks them. The third `folded` row holds an invisible U+200B ZERO WIDTH SPACE.

case one directory at any depth
line read-only .vscode
path .vscode read-only
path .vscode/tasks.json read-only
path apps/web/.vscode/tasks.json read-only
path .vscodex free
path vscode free
path x.vscode/tasks.json free
folded .VSCODE/tasks.json read-only
folded .vscode./tasks.json read-only
folded .vs​code/tasks.json read-only

case a later writable line lifts a file below a read-only directory
line read-only .vscode
line writable .vscode/settings.json
path .vscode/tasks.json read-only
path .vscode/settings.json free
path .vscode/settings.json/tasks.json free

case the reverse order keeps it read-only
line writable .vscode/settings.json
line read-only .vscode
path .vscode/settings.json read-only

case a star within one component
line read-only *.code-workspace
line writable demo.code-workspace
line read-only lefthook.*
path x.code-workspace read-only
path .code-workspace read-only
path demo.code-workspace free
path lefthook.yml read-only
path .config/lefthook.yml read-only
path lefthook free
path lefthook-local.yml free
path lefthook.d/x read-only

case a directory a line names through is pinned
line read-only .claude/settings.json
path .claude pinned
path .claude/settings.json read-only
path .claude/notes.md free
path x/.claude pinned
path x/.claude/settings.json read-only
path settings.json free
path .claude/x/settings.json free

case three components pin two
line read-only .kiro/settings/mcp.json
path .kiro pinned
path .kiro/settings pinned
path .kiro/settings/mcp.json read-only
path .kiro/steering/x.md free

case the same name cancelled
line read-only .claude/skills
line writable .claude/skills
path .claude/skills free
path .claude/skills/x/SKILL.md free
path .claude pinned

case a writable ancestor lifts what is below it
line read-only .claude/settings.json
line writable .claude
path .claude free
path .claude/settings.json free

case a dependency directory
line read-only .vscode
line read-only .claude/settings.json
line read-only .opencode
line writable node_modules
path node_modules free
path node_modules/inflection/.vscode/settings.json free
path node_modules/thread-stream/.claude free
path node_modules/thread-stream/.claude/settings.local.json free
path node_modules/p/.claude/settings.json free
path .opencode/node_modules/x/index.js free
path apps/.vscode/tasks.json read-only

case a later line pins inside a writable region
line writable node_modules
line read-only node_modules/foo/bar
path node_modules pinned
path node_modules/foo pinned
path node_modules/foo/bar read-only
path node_modules/other free

case the guard's paths decide over every rule line
line read-only .vscode
line writable node_modules
line read-only-path tools/githooks
line read-only-path node_modules/.hooks
line pinned-path alias
line pinned-path deep/link
path tools pinned
path tools/githooks read-only
path tools/githooks/pre-commit read-only
path apps/tools/githooks free
path node_modules/.hooks/pre-commit read-only
path alias pinned
path x/alias free
path tools/other free
path deep pinned
path deep/link pinned
path deep/other free

case a line naming an entry whole decides over its own interior at another alignment
line writable a*/a*
path ax pinned
path ax/ab free
path ax/ab/c free
